.091">果</span><span begin="0:52.341" end="0:52.679">总</span><span begin="0:52.679" end="0:53.382">是</span><span begin="0:54.031" end="0:54.639">我在</span><span begin="0:54.639" end="0:55.921">等</span></p><p begin="0:57.692" end="1:10.352" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:57.692" end="0:58.399">说话留</span><span begin="0:58.399" end="0:58.802">着</span><span begin="0:59.191" end="1:00.262">分寸</span> <span begin="1:01.901" end="1:02.160">气</span><span begin="1:02.160" end="1:02.669">氛</span><span begin="1:02.669" end="1:02.831">却</span><span begin="1:02.831" end="1:03.398">不</span><span begin="1:03.398" end="1:03.599">见</span><span begin="1:03.599" end="1:03.902">加</span><span begin="1:03.902" end="1:04.782">温</span> <span begin="1:06.812" end="1:06.941">爱</span><span begin="1:06.941" end="1:07.382">没</span><span begin="1:07.382" end="1:07.651">有</span><span begin="1:07.651" end="1:08.121">了</span><span begin="1:09.202" end="1:09.571">库</span><span begin="1:09.571" end="1:10.352">存</span></p><p begin="1:14.325" end="1:26.455" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.325" end="1:14.483">你</span><span begin="1:14.483" end="1:15.005">说</span><span begin="1:15.494" end="1:15.863">的</span><span begin="1:15.863" end="1:16.045">这</span><span begin="1:16.045" end="1:16.953">么</span><span begin="1:16.953" end="1:17.212">认</span><span begin="1:17.212" end="1:18.584">真</span> <span begin="1:21.524" end="1:22.223">显</span><span begin="1:22.223" end="1:22.655">得</span><span begin="1:22.884" end="1:23.323">我</span><span begin="1:23.455" end="1:24.042">存</span><span begin="1:24.042" end="1:24.523">心</span><span begin="1:24.523" end="1:24.803">敷</span><span begin="1:24.803" end="1:26.455">衍</span></p><p begin="1:28.133" end="1:34.914" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.133" end="1:28.562">这些</span><span begin="1:28.562" end="1:28.891">套</span><span begin="1:28.891" end="1:29.914">路</span><span begin="1:29.914" end="1:30.023">的</span><span begin="1:30.